                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much does Eid al-Adha drive for Muslim market D2C?</h3>
                                        <p>10-20% of annual Muslim market revenue. Smaller than Eid al-Fitr but still significant occasion.</p>
                                        <h3>Should non-Muslim brands do Eid al-Adha marketing?</h3>
                                        <p>For Muslim market brands: yes with cultural respect + authenticity + Islamic sensitivity. Not superficial marketing.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest Eid al-Adha D2C mistake?</h3>
                                        <p>Treating same as Eid al-Fitr. Different occasion themes + timing + retail scale + emphasis. Requires distinct approach.</p>
                                        <h3>Is halal certification essential?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes — halal + Islamic-appropriate certification + operational commitment essential for Muslim market credibility.</p>
